    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just about me being sad. it's the actual life i'm providing, or not providing. every time i look at them, i just feel like i'm taking away their chance at a better life by dragging them down with me. it feels so selfish to keep hanging on when i'm clearly just a drain on everything they have. like, is it even fair to keep forcing them to deal with me?",
